epeated ankle and foot surgeries are already priced in there. He is reported fully ready for the opener despite the Q tag, and Joe expects about 65.","sources":["https://youtu.be/BjXP9JODDSg?t=1003","https://youtu.be/LcZcvk8s1xQ?t=837","https://youtu.be/gJUBAJaHzlU?t=1271"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"Memphis shut him down late last season while tanking. The team is weak again, and his foot history makes a cautious March likely.","sources":["https://youtu.be/LcZcvk8s1xQ?t=890","https://youtu.be/LcZcvk8s1xQ?t=1864"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}